cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Ryndix Amazon category data"
abstract: >-
  Point-in-time measurements of Amazon US categories - units, revenue, price bands,
  review distribution, keyword demand, cost per click, fee load and pre-advertising
  unit economics - behind the published Ryndix category reviews. Five categories:
  under-desk treadmill (walking pad), home mold test kit, electric grill brush,
  affirmation cards, and the inflatable tanning pool sub-segment of pool rafts.
authors:
  - name: "Ryndix (Ylemos Inc)"
    website: "https://www.ryndix.com/"
version: "2026.09"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://www.ryndix.com/cases"
repository-code: "https://github.com/joke52tan/ryndix-category-data"
keywords:
  - amazon
  - product research
  - unit economics
  - category data
  - e-commerce
